  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:pulse_adapter",
      "text": [
        "Tribal Power makes Pulse; many other mods run on Forge Energy (FE). The Pulse Adapter is a one-way bridge: it turns Pulse from your generators into FE and hands it to the machines touching it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Setting it up",
      "text": [
        "Place the Adapter within **8 blocks** of a generator, and right against the FE machine it should feed. It pushes energy into any energy receiver on any of its faces.",
        "It converts **1 Pulse into 100 FE**, up to **20 Pulse** each second. Ranked adapters convert more Pulse, and so make more FE, in the same second.",
        "It buffers **16,000 FE** and exports to standard energy receivers. It cannot receive FE, so nothing can feed energy back into it."
      ]
    },
